{"structure": "notice", "color": "teal", "fields": {"title": "University Library Book Drop-Off", "subtitle": "", "body": "Most books may be returned at any time to the outdoor drop boxes located outside the entrance of any university library building.

• Oversized items (e.g., atlases) must be returned to the relevant library circulation desk.
• Check your online account to see if you have accrued any late fees."}}

